                <invention-title lang="de">SCHAUFEL EINER GASTURBINE AUS FASERLAGEN MIT INEINANDERGREIFENDEN FINGERN AM HINTEREN ENDE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROFIL AÉRODYNAMIQUE D'UNE TURBINE À GAZ CONSTITUÉ DE COUCHES DE FIBRES AYANT DES DOIGTS INTERDIGITÉS DANS L'EXTRÉMITÉ DE FUITE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">AIRFOIL OF A GAS TURBINE MADE OF FIBER PLIES HAVING INTERDIGITATED FINGERS IN TRAILING END</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An airfoil includes an airfoil section (64) defining suction and pressure sides (64c, 64d) and leading and a trailing ends (64a, 64b), the airfoil section (64) being formed of a fiber-reinforced composite (62) comprised of fiber plies (72), the fiber plies (72) including at least one core fiber ply (74) defining a tube (78a, 78b) that circumscribes an internal cavity (70) and an overwrap fiber ply (76) that wraps around the at least one core fiber ply (74), and aft of the internal cavity (70) the overwrap fiber ply (76) on the pressure side (64d) including first fingers and the overwrap ply (76) on the suction side (64c) including second fingers, the first fingers being interdigitated with the second fingers to form an interlocked joint (80) in the trailing end (64b).</p>
            </abstract>
